Package: SOMevidence
Title: Evidence Workflows for Self-Organizing Map Classification
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Shaowen", "Ye", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "76806529+shaowen-ye@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides explicit data-design objects, leakage-safe preprocessing,
    design-aware resampling, reproducible ensembles of self-organizing maps,
    and evidence-oriented diagnostics for ecological, environmental and
    evolutionary applications. The package separates the reproducibility of a
    continuous representation from the defensibility of a hard partition and
    supports explicit abstention when evidence is insufficient.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://shaowen-ye.r-universe.dev/SOMevidence,
    https://github.com/shaowen-ye/SOMevidence
BugReports: https://github.com/shaowen-ye/SOMevidence/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
